  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">The Art Gallery of The Guild of Harwich Artists</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder has-excerpt post-4781 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-meet-the-artist tag-sedona-summer tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-4781\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-sedona-summer/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Sedona summer coloring page.\" src=\"/media/archive/d15f63b1db2d25e8f070bb1c3614de447c80f0b6d2a9dd4e9f65a553e8044619.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-sedona-summer/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Meet The Artist Sedona Summer</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-11-19T20:02:36-05:00\" title=\"Tuesday, November 19, 2019, 8:02 pm\">November 19, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Sedona Summer will be featuring her children’s book, Spunky Sherry Sprite, the girl that loved to dance, at a Meet The Artist on December 7, 2019 from 1:00-4:00 p.m. at the Art Gallery of The Guild of Harwich Artists.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder has-excerpt post-4666 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-education category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-barbara-hageman tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-4666\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/barbara-hageman-demonstrates/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"375\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Four squares of paintings with blue and green paint on them.\" src=\"/media/archive/56723dc9e30a043aa4790f0dbb15dfd4a8a588e9ecba1be309329939b72cdfa3.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/barbara-hageman-demonstrates/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Barbara Hageman Demonstrates</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-07-27T10:00:52-04:00\" title=\"Saturday, July 27, 2019, 10:00 am\">July 27, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Harwich artist Barbara Hageman will demonstrate interpreting a painting from an iPhone photo into meaningful original work of art.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-4419 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-events category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-harwich-port tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-4419\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-mary-ann-simpson/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Meet the Artist Mary Ann Simpson</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-publishe